      "sha256": "c726b9838740376bddb33e16d37073350a2f2b0e243317be51ae1feafc1839b0",
      "kind": "figure",
      "alt": "Two visually identical forms demonstrate screen-reader focus order. Both show first name Jane, last name Doe, birthdate 01-01-2000, and a Submit button. In the accessible form, focus follows the visual top-to-bottom order: first name 1, last name 2, birthdate 3, Submit 4. In the inaccessible form, focus starts on Submit 1, then jumps to first name 2, last name 3, and birthdate 4."
    },
